Theorem know_lookupA0I_eq : forall bc kn segs rb rk n sx hints acc,
  know_lookupA0I bc (mk_kix kn) segs rb rk n sx hints acc = know_lookupA0B bc segs kn rb rk n sx hints acc.
Proof.
